{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "To me? Uh...": "",
  "...He's my boyfriend!": "",
  "And as my boyfriend, you aren't going to tolerate a <font_kind=yakuza_italic>stalker</font_kind>, right?": "",
  "(A stalker?)": "",
  "N-No way! How could I have missed that you got a boyfriend!?": "",
  "(Well, better keep up the charade...)": "",
  "You heard her. You mess with her, you mess with me. So I'd get lost if I were you.": "",
  "And he's... really strong! So don't even think about it!": "",
  "I-I get it... He's why you won't love me...": "",
  "Oh my gosh, thank you so much for playing along...": "",
  "I'm just glad it didn't come to blows.": "",
  "I'm Nanami Matsuoka. I work in an office nearby.": "",
  "I'm Yagami, a local detective. So that guy's been stalking you, huh?": "",
  "Yeah, and he's been getting more and more persistent. I'm at my wit's end.": "",
  "His name's Takeda, and he's been following me around off and on for about a year.": "",
  "Wow. I'm sorry you've had to deal with that.": "",
  "It's been kind of a nightmare. Just lately he even figured out where I live...": "",
  "That's pretty terrifying. I hope you've taken some precautions.": "",
  "Ugh... I just hope he's not going to bother you now that he thinks you're his rival...": "",
  "Eh, I'll be fine. On the other hand, maybe it'll make him give up.": "",
  "Hmm. I kinda doubt it.": "",
  "Don't let him hurt you, Yagami-san. I'd hate to see you get stabbed or something.": "",
  "Uh... I'll be careful.": "",
  "You said you were a detective, right, Yagami-san? Is a stalker something I could consult you about?": "",
  "Sure. I'm not picky about my jobs.": "",
  "Great! Can I get your contact info, then?": "",
  "Hm? Is that a smartwatch?": "",
  "Yeah, they're pretty popular now, huh? I can watch videos and even send messages on it.": "",
  "Wow, all that from a tiny little screen on your wrist. I'd get one myself if I could afford to splurge.": "",
  "Haha, yeah, I'm still figuring it out myself. Anyway. I'll be in touch!": "",
  "Hm? It's from Nanami-chan.": "",
  "It must be the guy from before... He kidnapped her!?": "",
  "No reply? Did the battery die? I hope that's all it is...": "",
  "I better get out and find her before that car moves.": "",
  "(All right, let's piece together what I know.)": "",
  "(I know the car is a black van.)": "",
  "(She was kidnapped on North Senryo Avenue, and then the car headed south and made five turns...)": "",
  "(They passed through somewhere crowded, and now she can smell ramen...)": "",
  "(Maybe I should write all this down.)": "",
  "I'm pretty worried about Nanami-chan... I've gotta find her!": "",
  "(A black van in front of a ramen shop... Is this it?)": "",
  "Ughh...": "",
  "It's all right. Lemme get you untied.": "",
  "Hey! What's going on!?": "",
  "Y-You're... Nanami-chan's boyfriend, aren't you!?": "",
  "You were already crossing the line, but now you've really done it, man.": "",
  "Sh-Shut up! A thug like you isn't worthy of Nanami-chan!": "",
  "Tch. And you are?": "",
  "Yes! And I'm sure she'll see it my way soon. Once we live together, she'll know I'm her true love!": "",
  "I've had enough of you. Time to come with me.": "",
  "I was... so scared.": "",
  "You did great. And it's all over now.": "",
  "Ahh...": "",
  "I had no idea you were really so strong, Yagami-san. I only said it to scare him, but it was real.": "",
  "You're like a real life hero.": "",
  "Haha, nah. Detectives end up on cases like this all the time.": "",
  "Don't be so modest! You were really cool.": "",
  "I owe you one, so I hope you'll let me return the favor someday soon?": "",
  "Heh, looking forward to the day.": "",
  "I'll message you later, then! Right now I think I've gotta give a few statements!": "",
  "(...I think that's enough info to approximate her location.)": "",
  "(I better see if she can give me any details.)": "",
  "(Crap! An alarm!? I need to get this shut down before I'm discovered!)": "",
  "(Huh? It stopped. Anyway, I need to hurry. Let's give this another shot.)": "",
  "Welcome! This is where you can register for drone races.": "",
  "Have you ever raced a drone before?": "",
  "If not, we recommend trying the test flight first.": "",
  "Would you like to race a test flight?": "",
  "Understood. Good luck!": "",
  "No problem. What would you like to do, then?": "",
  "Your drone's all set. Good luck!": "",
  "Would you like to continue the current grand prix?": "",
  "Would you like to restart your current grand prix?": "",
  "Good luck!": "",
  "Do you want opponents in your test flight?": "",
  "We hope you come back soon!": "",
  "This is the registration counter for the drone races that'll be starting up soon.": "",
  "We're still getting things together, so would you mind coming back soon?": "",
  "Congratulations on winning the grand prix! Here's the prize!": "",
  "Congratulations on getting first place! Here's the prize!": "",
  "Congratulations on getting second place! Here's the prize!": "",
  "Nice race! Here's the prize for 3rd place.": "",
  "Welcome. This is the drone lab. Care to develop parts?": "",
  "Thanks. Come back if you ever wanna make some more parts.": "",
  "(Should I play some pinball?)": "",
  "Hi, uh, I'm Yagami. You had a request for me, didn't you?": "",
  "...So you're Yagami. I've been waiting for you.": "",
  "Sorry about that. And your name is, sir?": "",
  "My name...?": "",
  "Amon. Shin Amon. You can call me Shin.": "",
  "No problem, Shin-san. So, would you like to tell me a little more about your request?": "",
  "Yes... My request to you is...": "",
  "A duel!": "",
  "A duel...? Sooo, you don't really need a detective?": "",
  "Why does it matter? I said I wanted a duel. Or are you saying you need a deposit first?": "",
  "No no no, I think you've got the wrong idea. I don't \"duel.\"": "",
  "We have laws against that, you know. You can get arrested for dueling.": "",
  "What do you mean, huh?": "",
  "After everything you've done... You would hide behind the law?": "",
  "You've committed assault, fraud, breaking and entering... But you won't duel? That's just rude!": "",
  "Rude? Self-defense is one thing, but you're literally asking me to duel you. That's a non-starter.": "",
  "I-In that case, forget the request! I take it all back!": "",
  "Instead, I'll just attack you! And you'll defend yourself! ...Perfectly legal, right?": "",
  "Well, strictly speaking, no, but... it would work?": "",
  "Then we have an accord. Prepare yourself for my onslaught!": "",
  "Wait, wait, wait! What's all this about, anyway? Why me?": "",
  "So many questions! It's because you're the reigning master of this city!": "",
  "You've solved so many problems and become so well-liked. You're kind of on fire right now, as far as this city goes.": "",
  "In other words, you've become worthy of combating me over the title of the city's strongest!": "",
  "Really? Fame has its price, doesn't it? But I guess it's better than being a nobody with no work...": "",
  "Heh, so you finally understand that this is... your destiny!": "",
  "Yeah, yeah. Sure. Wait... I don't get any of this, actually.": "",
  "Are you ready, then? I'll warn you just in case, but I am quite powerful!": "",
  "Uh, I'm actually a little busy now? How about a raincheck?": "",
  "Well, I suppose that's fine. Victory would be hollow if I beat you at anything but your strongest.": "",
  "Prepare yourself well!": "",
  "I will wait for you here, forevermore. When you're ready to be assaulted, come find me.": "",
  "Really...? I still think this is pretty weird, but I also get the sense that I should probably just get it over with.": "",
  "Very well. But this is not the place.": "",
  "Our duel requires a place that would be... more appropriate!": "",
  "...You've come. Have you thoroughly prepared yourself?": "",
  "Yes, the time has come! Takayuki Yagami...": "",
  "Our duel is now!": "",
  "N-No way... I can't believe I lost...": "",
  "Uh, does this mean I can go home? See you around?": "",
  "Wait. Wait wait wait.": "",
  "This is the part where you ask why I challenged you, isn't it!? Where you urge me to reveal my true motivation!?": "",
  "...Tch, do I have to?": "",
  "Hey! Did you just \"tch\" me!? Are you always this rude!?": "",
  "Ugh, have it your way. What's your true motivation...?": "",
  "Naturally, I am compelled by only one thing in life... To become the strongest!": "",
  "Every man discovers that side of himself at some point! We all aspire to it! Even you must have thought it!": "",
  "Nah, that was never really my thing.": "",
  "We all aspire to reach our proverbial mountain peaks in our chosen fields! That is the fate of my entire family...": "",
  "He's not listening to a word I'm saying.": "",
  "Yet I am clearly still too far from the top.": "",
  "Yagami... You are this city's champion. I can admit that with grace.": "",
  "However, it's temporary, okay!? It probably won't last more than a year! You got that!?": "",
  "I don't know if I'd call that grace...": "",
  "I will return to defeat you! And to defeat you, I will return! Yagami!!!": "",
  "Hey, hold up!": "",
  "(Damn, that guy was nuts. Kinda ironic for a detective to have a stalker...)": "",
  "(And I still don't know who he really was. Not sure that's a mystery I'll ever solve, either.)": "",
  "(You know, I've been working pretty hard lately. Maybe I need a vacation.)": "",
  "Wh-What just happened!?": "",
  "Let's not worry about the details.": "",
  "Fine, this was weird to begin with.": "",
  "Alright, let's go!": "",
  "We're back to where we started... Seriously, what just happened?": "",
  "(It's a police baton.\nI don't think I could get the gate down with this.)": "",
  "(There's nothing...)": "",
  "(The cervical spine is broken.\nDeath had to have been instant.)": "",
  "(Something's shining.)": "",
  "(A gold keycard! This is it!\nThis'll open the gate to the research wing!)": "",
  "(I shouldn't be wasting time.\nI have to secure Kuroiwa quickly...!)": "",
  "Hey, Kaito-san?": "",
  "Yo. How's the Saori-san situation?": "",
  "Going well. The Queen Rouge hired her on the spot.": "",
  "Nice. That means you're free right now, yeah?": "",
  "Yeah...?": "",
  "Well, guess what? I've got a job for you, Tak.": "",
  "Yeah, and it's urgent. Get down to Public Park Three, man.": "",
  "I'll explain when you get there. Just come on down.": "",
  "...Annnd he hung up.": "",
  "(What are you playing at, Kaito-san? But if it's urgent...)": "",
  "Come oooooon! Do it! Do the Captain Cop pose!": "",
  "Kaito-san, what are you doing? Didn't you say this was urgent?": "",
  "Yeah, and I meant it.": "",
  "Okay, who's the client?": "",
  "I am. I need you to do something about this little brat, Tak.": "",
  "He's following me around like a lost puppy!": "",
  "...What did you do?": "",
  "I can't believe I found Captain Cop, mister!": "",
  "Captain... what?": "",
  "You don't know? Captain Cop! He's the police superhero who protects the city!": "",
  "He totally betrayed the evil organization who augmented him to fight crime instead!": "",
  "You're losing me here...": "",
  "This ankle-biter was about to get kidnapped by some yakuza, and I stopped it. But now I've got a fan.": "",
  "He's sooo strong! He punched those dudes' lights out! It was all like, bam! Crack!": "",
  "(The kid must think he's some kind of TV super hero.)": "",
  "He didn't transform, though. Probably because you didn't have this, Captain Cop.": "",
  "You have to hold onto it and do this!": "",
  "Captain...": "",
  "That's how you transform into Captain Cop!": "",
  "Oh yeah? You should give it a shot, Kaito-san.": "",
  "Hey, what's your name, kid?": "",
  "Yusuke Okabayashi! I'm five!": "",
  "Do you know where your dad or your mom is?": "",
  "My dad usually stops working about now. So I came to pick him up.": "",
  "You came all the way to Kamurocho to \"pick him up\"? And that's where you met the bad men?": "",
  "Yeah. They asked where my dad was, but I didn't say anything. Then they tried to get me.": "",
  "Then the yakuza were after his father? Why would they go after a kid?": "",
  "Beats me. But we probably better hurry, or the kid's father could end up in the same situation.": "",
  "True. If yakuza are involved, it's gonna be bad news.": "",
  "Yup. Go do your thing, Tak.": "",
  "Oh, is that what your job is? Fine. But I need some more info on this guy.": "",
  "Hey, Yusuke-kun. Can you tell me what your dad looks like? His face, his hair, his weight?": "",
  "Sure! Umm... He's skinny! He wears nice clothes... His eyes are tiny... And his hair is short!": "",
  "All right, that should be enough to go on.": "",
  "Where'd you find the kid, Kaito-san?": "",
  "Down Suppon Street.": "",
  "All right, I'll go check out the area.": "",
  "C'mon mister, you have to do the Captain Cop pose! I know you're him!": "",
  "...Tak.": "",
  "Do me a favor and find this guy. Quickly.": "",
  "(Heh, guess I better find this guy before Kaito-san tears his hair out...)": "",
  "(Looks like Kaito-san made quite a scene.)": "",
  "(It would help me out if I could find any clues about the yakuza trying to kidnap him...)": "",
  "(My only lead is a pocket tissues ad... What do I do now?)": "",
  "Kaito?": "",
  "Hey, Tak. I know you're busy, but would you mind picking up a bento from a convenience store or something?": "",
  "I'm thinking if I feed the kid, it'll shut up him.": "",
  "Huh? Can't you handle that on your own?": "",
  "You want me to cruise around town with a kid? Come on man, I've got an image to uphold.": "",
  "What, you afraid people'll think you kidnapped him? Or worse, that he's yours?": "",
  "You know how it is. Come strong for me, Tak.": "",
  "Really? ...Fine. I'll pick one up.": "",
  "(Actually, Kaito-san might have heard about this Yakumaru Loans company, especially if they've got yakuza ties.)": "",
  "(...At least delivering the bento gives me an excuse to ask him.)": "",
  "Good throw, Yusuke.": "",
  "Heh, I threw it like you did!": "",
  "See? Once you know how to do it, it's easy-peasy.": "",
  "Oh, Tak. What's up?": "",
  "What do you mean, \"what's up?\" Didn't you ask me to get you a bento?": "",
  "Oh, yeah, I did. Mind giving it to me?": "",
  "(Damn. I don't seem to have one.)": "",
  "Wait, you didn't get it?": "",
  "Yeah, not sure what I was trying to accomplish here. Lemme come back real quick.": "",
  "Chop chop, huh? Yusuke's starving.": "",
  "Thanks, man. I'll feed the kid.": "",
  "By the way, Kaito-san. You ever heard of a \"Yakumaru Loans\"?": "",
  "I found this ad in some pocket tissues near where the attack happened.": "",
  "Yakumaru Loans? Can't say it rings any bells.": "",
  "Well, I'm just a civilian.": "",
  "Haha, a <font_kind=yakuza_italic>shady</font_kind> civilian. But if you don't know anything, I'm at a dead end...": "",
  "Did you say Yakumaru Loans, mister? I know that name!": "",
  "What? Really?": "",
  "My dad says they're bad yakuza men, so don't go anywhere near 'em!": "",
  "Well, at least I was right about the yakuza ties.": "",
  "But that's not good. If the yakuza are hunting down the kid's dad, they've probably already got him.": "",
  "Well, I'll leave that part to you, Tak. I'll keep an eye on Yusuke.": "",
  "Yeah, looks like you're a better babysitter than I am.": "",
  "Hey, mister. Let's play more catch!": "",
  "Sure. Let's do it!": "",
  "(He can complain all he wants... I think he's enjoying this.)": "",
  "(But if they already have Yusuke's father, I better get a move on.)": "",
  "Oh, Tak. You get that bento?": "",
  "(The Ushimata Family office should be around here...)": "",
  "(Here's the tricky part. I don't know which one of these offices is theirs...)": "",
  "(What is he doing...?)": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Hey! What's going on!?": "เฮ้! เกิดอะไรขึ้น!?",
  "Ahh...": "อาห์...",
  "Good luck!": "สู้ๆ นะคะ!",
  "My name...?": "ชื่อฉันเหรอ...?",
  "Hey, hold up!": "เฮ้ ช้าก่อน!",
  "Yeah...?": "เหรอ...?",
  "Captain...": "กัปตัน...",
  "What? Really?": "อะไรนะ จริงเหรอ"
 }
}
